# PlayerSettleOrHurt (81:DD88), which nothing in the game calls, settled:
# unit_dead_81.box's calls (level 1) find no floor under its probe 8
# (x+-5, y-16). Here, stage a3 s1 as cov_held_jump_off.box to frame 86,
# Aladdin hanging from the ledge at x $007F, y $00A1; in its frame 87 he
# drops and PlayerLandOrHurt settles him on that ledge at y $00C0. Its
# tile is the column x $0070-$007F, rows $00A0-$00AF (behaviour $8A: kind
# $70, a floor, not passed through, not hurting; at x $0084 the map is
# empty). A unit call by JSR, M and X 8-bit, DB $80, D the player's
# record, with his x $0078 and y $00B8 (probe 8, x+-5 and his own x at y
# $00A8, all in that tile): settled at y $00C0, the ground not
# hurting (TILE_BEHAVIOUR bit 5 clear), back with A = 1 (81:DD8E, its BRA
# to PlayerLandOrHurt's settled tail); the machine put back after.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a3_s1.state
hold Y+RIGHT 23
hold RIGHT 13
hold LEFT 50
set 0008E7 78,00
set 0008EA B8,00
call 81DD88 p=30 db=80 d=08DB
